# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/controls/alv-grid.md#32-coloured-packet
# provenance: PV-0943, PV-0944, PV-0945
# kind: alv-colour-cells
# description: A coloured row packet: two rows of two invented cells, one intensified colour 5, one inverse colour 6, two uncoloured.
# derivation: 448-byte slots, marker slot then one slot per column (PV-0943); cell slot fields u32 LE column, row index, colour field, then text (PV-0944); colour fields 1 + (5 | 8) = 14 and 1 + (6 | 16) = 23 (PV-0945); undescribed marker-slot bytes are arbitrary (zero, then 0xEE) and ignored.
